Description: Instagram desktop client without Reels or Explore
 The full Instagram experience - feed, profiles, messages, follow requests,
 private accounts, notifications, settings and teen/parental supervision -
 with Reels and Explore kept out.
 .
 GramChat embeds Instagram's web client (WebKitGTK) and enforces a
 Reels/Explore blocklist at two levels: a native navigation guard that
 bounces Reels/Explore routes back to the Home feed, and an in-page SPA guard
 that does the same for the client-side router and hides the Reels/Explore
 links. Voice and video calls work through Instagram's WebRTC client.